/* ---------- Rich text editor ---------- */
/* a minimal editor for a draft an agent helps with: a formatting toolbar, the text, and a quiet foot with the word count and
   undo. Select text and press Ask AI (or the shortcut, or type / on a new line), and the suggestion streams in beside the
   text, the old words struck through, to accept with Tab or discard with Esc. The editor keeps one height, so it sits still */
.rte{position:relative;width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--dm-surface);border-radius:var(--dm-r-card);box-shadow:var(--dm-shadow);transition:box-shadow .32s;container:rte/inline-size;
  /* its quiet text (--dm-rte-q: the word count, the placeholder, struck words) and secondary text (--dm-rte-q2: the status, Discard,
     quotes). In dark mode the shared greys reach 4.5:1 but not APCA Lc 60 at these sizes, so they come up toward the text colour */
  --dm-rte-q:var(--dm-muted);--dm-rte-q2:var(--dm-fg2)}
